# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers (Vite copies it into the build output).
# Cross-origin isolation matches `pnpm dev`/`preview` (vite.config.ts): the profiler gets ~5 µs timers.
# Consequence: every cross-origin resource (R2, fonts, …) must send CORP or CORS headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Vite content-hashes everything in /assets, so it can be cached forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
